{"id":"f96b718e3ca3e61b","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-set.md","title":"set","display":"df-set — set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-set","aliases":["57-df-set"],"display":"df-set — set","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set — set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>背景为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,X,Y\">\\(x,X,Y\\)</span> 遍历集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为全体集合的可定义类，不作为集合量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}(x)\\leftrightarrow x=x,\\qquad V\\coloneqq\\{x:\\mathrm{Set}(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Set}(x)\\leftrightarrow x=x,\\qquad V\\coloneqq\\{x:\\mathrm{Set}(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\\coloneqq\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\},\\qquad\nY\\subseteq X\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\,(z\\in Y\\to z\\in X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P(X)\\coloneqq\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\},\\qquad\nY\\subseteq X\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\,(z\\in Y\\to z\\in X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}(x)\\leftrightarrow x=x,\\qquad V\\coloneqq\\{x:\\mathrm{Set}(x)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)\\coloneqq\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\},\\qquad\nY\\subseteq X\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\,(z\\in Y\\to z\\in X).","display":true}],"bytes":778,"backlinks":[{"id":"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 为集合，$\\mathcal F$ 为候选子集族，$A,B\\subseteq I$，见 [[57-df-set]]。$\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal F,I)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Filter}(I)$ 分别是谓词与满足该谓词的集合族；保留两种原调用形式。"},{"id":"be9e6bea58d776c6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8d7c3b177f76a494","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e985db086a1eebfb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V$ 为集合，$E\\subseteq V\\times V$，$G=\\langle V,E\\rangle$；集合见 [[57-df-set]]。$k\\in\\mathbb N$，见 [[57-df-omega]]；$\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}=\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:1\\le j\\le k\\}$，所以 $k=0$ 时颜色集为空。不额外要求边关系对称或无自环。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]\n[[57-df-indexed-product]]\n[[57-df-infinite]]\n[[57-df-injective]]\n[[57-df-mgu]]\n[[57-df-natural-number]]\n[[57-df-omega]]\n[[57-df-ordered-pair]]\n[[57-df-partial-function]]\n[[57-df-pow-fin]]\n[[57-df-range]]\n[[57-df-relation-domain]]\n[[57-df-relation-symbol]]\n[[5